# Welding at a tool station (decision C17): a ceramic disc into the
# vise; arm A picks a second disc while the positioner brings a point
# 6 mm down the first's lead 2 to the stations' working point; arm A
# lays the second disc's lead there;
# station S3's welder extends onto the lap and discharges; the second
# disc stays, welded on.
reset circuit=weld
tool A tweezers
pick A C1 grasp=body
place A C1 at=0,0,-32
vise close
release A C1
lift A mm=60
pick A C2 grasp=body
present C1.2.6 at=S3
move A to=0,40,40 rpy=-90,0,90
align A C2.1.tip to=C1.2.6 gap=0.1
weld S3 at=C1.2+C2.1 energy=8
inspect C1.2+C2.1
release A C2
lift A mm=40
